                                                "sense_id": "59e5d8d0-c920-3ffd-bd50-29502603f55a",
                                                "text": "He's a lusty, jolly fellow, that lives well, at least three yards in the girth."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "53169918-a0bd-35d5-aee1-0bb4029898e8",
